RELAXED_BOX 71.6536010606579 71.6460889919579 71.6519115476585

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-26.9740390470181)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-26.9740390470181)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
