# Obtain new stress tensor

variable tmp equal pxx
variable pxx1 equal ${tmp}
variable pxx1 equal -5.84107047235829
variable tmp equal pyy
variable pyy1 equal ${tmp}
variable pyy1 equal 103.228788556901
variable tmp equal pzz
variable pzz1 equal ${tmp}
variable pzz1 equal -24.037820645682
variable tmp equal pxy
variable pxy1 equal ${tmp}
variable pxy1 equal 125.300524843012
variable tmp equal pxz
variable pxz1 equal ${tmp}
variable pxz1 equal 43.1996462555638
variable tmp equal pyz
variable pyz1 equal ${tmp}
variable pyz1 equal -43.5167445612086

# Compute elastic constant from pressure tensor

variable C1neg equal ${d1}
variable C1neg equal -3281.51095193764
variable C2neg equal ${d2}
variable C2neg equal -8481.1276751204
variable C3neg equal ${d3}
variable C3neg equal -5788.70785956337
variable C4neg equal ${d4}
variable C4neg equal 31.7004720563901
variable C5neg equal ${d5}
variable C5neg equal -26.8923166385498
variable C6neg equal ${d6}
variable C6neg equal -227.505469547501

# Reset box and simulation parameters

clear
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
box tilt large

The 'box' command has been removed and will be ignored

read_restart restart.equil
Reading restart file ...
  restart file = 22 Jul 2025, LAMMPS = 22 Jul 2025
  restoring atom style atomic from restart
  triclinic box = (-0.0018005303 0.001955504 -0.00095577383) to (71.651801 71.648044 71.650956) with tilt (0 0 0)
